      {
        "Id": "65209f9ed5d047e29f2eace472c919f3",
        "Title": "HOW TO USE  -  in node 1 click SELECT, pick the rooms, FINISH, Run   (or switch on ALL rooms)\nDraw the bulkhead in plan / ceiling plan with detail lines (or use the CAD layer).  CLOSED loop = bulkhead area.  Line from wall to wall = the smaller side is bulkhead.\nPeripheral bulkhead: draw the loop of the PLAIN ceiling and switch 'Closed loop = BULKHEAD' off.   Rooms with no lines get a plain ceiling.\nSide board closes the drop; COVE on = trough: bulkhead runs past the edge with an upstand lip, LED inside.  Run again any time: replaced, never doubled.",
        "DescriptionText": null,
        "IsExpanded": true,
        "WidthAdjustment": 0.0,
        "HeightAdjustment": 0.0,
        "Nodes": [],
        "HasNestedGroups": false,
        "Left": 0.0,
